      "lines": [
        {
          "n": "0",
          "text": "I never would've thought that",
          "rhyme": "a",
          "persona_id": "persona_wolf_haley"
        },
        {
          "n": "1",
          "text": "Feelings could get thrown in the air",
          "rhyme": "ER",
          "persona_id": "persona_wolf_haley"
        },
        {
          "n": "2",
          "text": "'Cause I accidentally caught that",
          "rhyme": "a",
          "persona_id": "persona_wolf_haley"
        },
        {
          "n": "3",
          "text": "I need some new boxing gloves",
          "rhyme": "Ov",
          "persona_id": "persona_wolf_haley"
        },
        {
          "n": "4",
          "text": "Shit got hectic whenever I fought back",
          "rhyme": "ak",
          "persona_id": "persona_wolf_haley"
        },
        {
          "n": "5",
          "text": "For example, ten minutes can't go past without you brushing my thoughts",
          "rhyme": "ajt",
          "persona_id": "persona_wolf_haley"
        },
        {
          "n": "6",
          "text": "That's fourteen forty a day so I'll say a hundred and forty-four times",
          "rhyme": "im",
          "persona_id": "persona_wolf_haley"
        },
        {
          "n": "7",
          "text": "I think about you or something like that",
          "rhyme": "a",
          "persona_id": "persona_wolf_haley"
        },
        {
          "n": "8",
          "text": "Lost match, the fucking thought of you with somebody else",
          "rhyme": "yls",
          "persona_id": "persona_wolf_haley"
        },
        {
          "n": "9",
          "text": "I don't like that, cellular convos getting left in the wrong",
          "rhyme": "$g",
          "persona_id": "persona_wolf_haley"
        },
        {
          "n": "10",
          "text": "'Cause I get so fucking mad when you don't write back",
          "rhyme": "ak",
          "persona_id": "persona_wolf_haley"
        },
        {
          "n": "11",
          "text": "This isn't a song, I just happen to rhyme when I get emo",
          "rhyme": "o",
          "persona_id": "persona_wolf_haley"
        },
        {
          "n": "12",
          "text": "And find time to write facts, fuck",
          "rhyme": "yk",
          "persona_id": "persona_wolf_haley"
        },
        {
          "n": "13",
          "text": "I love you",
          "rhyme": "u",
          "persona_id": "persona_wolf_haley"
        },
        {
          "n": "14",
          "text": "Can we add some more color, um, like, some more, yellow?",
          "rhyme": "o",
          "persona_id": "persona_wolf_haley"
        },
        {
          "n": "15",
          "text": "Yeah, that's good",
          "rhyme": "ud",
          "persona_id": "persona_wolf_haley"
        }
      ],
      "rhyme": "ABACDEFAGHDIJKIL",
      "rhyme_vowel": "ABACAADAEFAGEHGH"
