      "lines": [
        {
          "n": "0",
          "text": "Girl, you fucking with my emotions",
          "rhyme": "$",
          "persona_id": "persona_wolf_haley"
        },
        {
          "n": "1",
          "text": "The fuck is all this noise about?",
          "rhyme": "u",
          "persona_id": "persona_wolf_haley"
        },
        {
          "n": "2",
          "text": "I even considered picking up smoking",
          "rhyme": "iN",
          "persona_id": "persona_wolf_haley"
        },
        {
          "n": "3",
          "text": "You turned to a bitch, who let the dogs out?",
          "rhyme": "awt",
          "persona_id": "persona_wolf_haley"
        },
        {
          "n": "4",
          "text": "But in my dog house",
          "rhyme": "awz",
          "persona_id": "persona_wolf_haley"
        },
        {
          "n": "5",
          "text": "My bitch is the raddest",
          "rhyme": "Est",
          "persona_id": "persona_wolf_haley"
        },
        {
          "n": "6",
          "text": "Crazy who makes me the happiest can make me the saddest",
          "rhyme": "Est",
          "persona_id": "persona_wolf_haley"
        },
        {
          "n": "7",
          "text": "Look, Alice, let's get lost in your wonder-er-land, fuck an atlas",
          "rhyme": "as",
          "persona_id": "persona_wolf_haley"
        },
        {
          "n": "8",
          "text": "You're perfectly perfect for me",
          "rhyme": "@",
          "persona_id": "persona_wolf_haley"
        },
        {
          "n": "9",
          "text": "What the fuck is this, practice?",
          "rhyme": "is",
          "persona_id": "persona_wolf_haley"
        },
        {
          "n": "10",
          "text": "Actually, if you even consider leaving",
          "rhyme": "iN",
          "persona_id": "persona_wolf_haley"
        },
        {
          "n": "11",
          "text": "I'll lose a couple screws in due time, I'll stop breathin'",
          "rhyme": "in",
          "persona_id": "persona_wolf_haley"
        },
        {
          "n": "12",
          "text": "And you'll see the meaning of stalkin'",
          "rhyme": "in",
          "persona_id": "persona_wolf_haley"
        },
        {
          "n": "13",
          "text": "When I pop out the dark to find you",
          "rhyme": "u",
          "persona_id": "persona_wolf_haley"
        },
        {
          "n": "14",
          "text": "And that new dude that you're seein' with an attitude",
          "rhyme": "yd",
          "persona_id": "persona_wolf_haley"
        },
        {
          "n": "15",
          "text": "Then proceed to fuck up your evenin'",
          "rhyme": ")",
          "persona_id": "persona_wolf_haley"
        },
        {
          "n": "16",
          "text": "Make sure you never meet again like goddamn vegans",
          "rhyme": "#",
          "persona_id": "persona_wolf_haley"
        },
        {
          "n": "17",
          "text": "'Cause when I hear your name, I cannot stop cheesin'",
          "rhyme": ")",
          "persona_id": "persona_wolf_haley"
        },
        {
          "n": "18",
          "text": "I love you so much that my heart stops beatin' when you're leavin'",
          "rhyme": ")",
          "persona_id": "persona_wolf_haley"
        },
        {
          "n": "19",
          "text": "And I'm grievin' and my heart starts bleedin'",
          "rhyme": ")",
          "persona_id": "persona_wolf_haley"
        },
        {
          "n": "20",
          "text": "Life without you has no goddamn meanin'",
          "rhyme": ")",
          "persona_id": "persona_wolf_haley"
        },
        {
          "n": "21",
          "text": "Sorry, I'm passive-aggressive for no goddamn reason",
          "rhyme": "$",
          "persona_id": "persona_wolf_haley"
        },
        {
          "n": "22",
          "text": "It's that my mood change like these goddamn seasons",
          "rhyme": "$",
          "persona_id": "persona_wolf_haley"
        },
        {
          "n": "23",
          "text": "I fall for you, but I love you",
          "rhyme": "u",
          "persona_id": "persona_wolf_haley"
        }
      ],
